 nHis hit podcast\, Flagrant \, co-hosted with Akaash Singh\, commands a loy
 al audience of 5 million weekly viewers and recently crossed 1.4 billion to
 tal views on YouTube. He also co-hosts The Brilliant Idiots Podcast alongsi
 de Charlamagne tha God. These listeners come to Schulz not only for laughte
 r but also all things culture: from theology to sports to politics. The New
